WEBVTT

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.500
"Incoming Call

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.500
Naru"

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:09.080
"Iwato Central Clinic

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:09.080
Fukai Medical Practice"

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:32.540
"Unable to Connect"

00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:28.680
"To Be Continued"

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:35.310
<i>The pounding beat of my heart</i>

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:42.270
<i>Had become a familiar part</i>

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:42.270
<i>of me before I knew it</i>

00:22:42.520 --> 00:22:48.200
<i>Even if there's a stiff wind blowing</i>

00:22:48.450 --> 00:22:54.330
<i>I'll always be looking ahead, eyes wide open</i>

00:22:54.580 --> 00:23:01.920
<i>If you ever feel like crying, remember</i>

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:07.970
<i>The promise we silently swore to one another</i>

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:14.010
<i>The song of a fledgling taking wing</i>

00:23:14.260 --> 00:23:19.600
<i>Even now, still unable to fly well</i>

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:25.610
<i>But over time that comes and goes</i>

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:27.820
<i>Single-mindedly</i>

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:31.160
<i>Following those joined hands</i>

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>"So I never let you go!!" Those words</i>

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:42.830
<i>Even if they only vanish into the sky</i>

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:48.880
<i>Inside the scattering lights</i>

00:23:49.130 --> 00:23:51.010
<i>Unwaveringly</i>

00:23:51.260 --> 00:23:56.600
<i>I know I can find you</i>

00:23:58.890 --> 00:24:02.690
"Preview"
